{"model": "Chatterbox Turbo (MLX 8-bit)", "segments": [{"text": "Sometimes you may need to setup custom environments beyond the standard test, development, and production that rails comes with.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/d85c8bff90cab7e4a9042b7b846d7f04ecd5dc5dae4a2d23dd71d189e832afcc.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.38], [1, 0.38, 0.66], [2, 0.66, 0.78], [3, 0.78, 0.96], [4, 0.96, 1.1], [6, 1.36, 1.74], [7, 1.74, 2.24], [8, 2.24, 2.64], [9, 2.64, 2.84], [10, 2.84, 3.14], [11, 3.14, 3.62], [12, 3.98, 4.34], [14, 4.64, 5.06], [15, 5.06, 5.34], [16, 5.34, 5.5], [17, 5.5, 5.82], [18, 5.82, 6.08]]}, {"text": "If you would like to have your staging server configured a little big differently than test and production (maybe higher logging levels for example), then you would need to create another environment for these configurations called staging.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/6daaebe968bd6454eb39b7d5f8c6907a10e033678b0b4f2f5f9ab220878ada82.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.48], [3, 0.48, 0.66], [4, 0.66, 0.82], [5, 0.82, 0.98], [6, 0.98, 1.18], [7, 1.18, 1.48], [8, 1.48, 1.96], [9, 1.96, 2.46], [10, 2.46, 2.66], [11, 2.66, 2.82], [13, 2.98, 3.44], [14, 3.44, 3.72], [15, 3.72, 4.1], [16, 4.1, 4.24], [17, 4.24, 4.7], [18, 5.3, 5.7], [19, 5.7, 6.12], [20, 6.12, 6.42], [21, 6.42, 6.74], [22, 6.9, 6.96], [23, 6.96, 7.38], [24, 7.9, 8.16], [25, 8.16, 8.32], [26, 8.32, 8.44], [27, 8.44, 8.6], [28, 8.6, 8.76], [29, 8.76, 8.98], [30, 8.98, 9.3], [31, 9.3, 9.88], [32, 9.88, 10.08], [33, 10.08, 10.3], [34, 10.3, 10.98], [35, 10.98, 11.44], [36, 11.44, 11.96]]}, {"text": "Changes, Additions and Edits", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ec2d8ce1323b109abeeee2b91d6d554dcd0bfcefa545ab8e95f5ce0452684ec2.mp3"}, {"text": "Gemfile", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/5257ca2e3c55904a94661d2f0645d3e464472816f973d8ff4daf95511803e9a3.mp3"}, {"text": "In your Gemfile, you should add your new environment to the necessary groups.", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a1ec9f5d65f979176ece356fca0306a78d6b60eaea1619d77ca85673eb8dc8b3.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.12], [1, 0.12, 0.24], [3, 0.94, 1.0], [4, 1.0, 1.16], [5, 1.16, 1.32], [6, 1.32, 1.48], [7, 1.48, 1.64], [8, 1.64, 2.14], [9, 2.14, 2.4], [10, 2.4, 2.5], [11, 2.5, 2.88], [12, 2.88, 3.24]]}, {"text": "If your environment is similar to production, you should add staging next to everywhere you see the production group lie below.", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/77b2882b074978bac080bc82b019d265fb3697ba0ed3f79d3f18f651d7319f4f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.9], [3, 0.9, 1.14], [4, 1.14, 1.42], [5, 1.42, 1.58], [6, 1.58, 1.96], [7, 2.48, 2.56], [8, 2.56, 2.68], [9, 2.68, 2.94], [10, 2.94, 3.44], [11, 3.44, 3.76], [12, 3.76, 3.94], [13, 3.94, 4.32], [14, 4.32, 4.52], [15, 4.52, 4.7], [16, 4.7, 4.82], [17, 4.82, 5.2], [18, 5.2, 5.52], [20, 5.76, 6.0]]}, {"text": "Update config/database.yml", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c725f19081782a9fa508c4c95c00e0695b1875592f38a1bfa8cb59d2cdc7a3da.mp3"}, {"text": "You should create a new environment in your database.yml file.", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/d65e025af5336dbf522270a11e3d8857add6b795958846667301088d9d35743a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.12], [1, 0.12, 0.28], [2, 0.28, 0.62], [3, 0.62, 0.8], [4, 0.8, 0.94], [5, 0.94, 1.46], [6, 1.46, 1.68], [7, 1.68, 1.8], [9, 2.82, 3.14]]}, {"text": "This will look something like this", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/fbb809e4505832d7904f46a702a449fd1f45086d8de3814da2a69957df44ba6d.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.58], [3, 0.58, 0.88], [4, 0.88, 1.14], [5, 1.14, 1.48]]}, {"text": "Environment Config", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/3e6b7956ecb1fa7b5c3089c57f1c40b6e2d242ab676482358b237175f9b3a947.mp3"}, {"text": "In config/environments/, you should add staging.rb.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/045afdc74bdd723c3aaadccfb200c910fcee58fb823d92d15d93ea772d85ae9f.mp3"}, {"text": "To make things easy, copy an existing environment that is most similar to the new one you are creating and make the adjustments you need from there.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f0772004bc5448d9849756d6d02b061ba2cf4528fb93b834fe3dc399ae039c38.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.5], [3, 0.5, 0.92], [4, 1.22, 1.42], [5, 1.42, 1.6], [6, 1.6, 1.94], [7, 1.94, 2.48], [8, 2.48, 2.72], [9, 2.72, 2.84], [10, 2.84, 3.04], [11, 3.04, 3.42], [12, 3.42, 3.62], [13, 3.62, 3.72], [14, 3.72, 3.88], [15, 3.88, 4.04], [16, 4.04, 4.2], [17, 4.2, 4.28], [18, 4.28, 4.66], [19, 4.66, 4.92], [20, 4.92, 5.08], [21, 5.08, 5.28], [22, 5.28, 5.68], [23, 5.68, 6.02], [24, 6.02, 6.22], [25, 6.22, 6.44], [26, 6.44, 6.7]]}, {"text": "Update Secrets.yml", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/4595d69726ba41e785d1d6518a2821b8e9b4cd14a4dee67321643d4a002246b3.mp3"}, {"text": "If you are running rails 4.1, you will also need to update your secrets.yml file to handle new the new environment", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/d38246b2c2bb15d758a130bd15b0490a62448c42e59f72c483824a98976c9cd4.mp3"}, {"text": "Misc", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/78bad5666e37b453d2e72a1e4738a2e1148663bfa721dd21baab65d89ac2778b.mp3"}, {"text": "Do a quick find on your project directory for any environment specific code being run.", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/42ff2fff1f361c35d09b417925a2519c36a035e8eb13472ff7b71a4db3750705.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.12], [1, 0.12, 0.24], [3, 0.38, 0.68], [4, 0.68, 0.84], [5, 0.84, 0.96], [6, 0.96, 1.28], [7, 1.28, 1.82], [8, 1.82, 2.12], [9, 2.12, 2.34], [10, 2.34, 2.82], [11, 2.82, 3.32], [12, 3.32, 3.68], [13, 3.68, 3.9], [14, 3.9, 4.18]]}, {"text": "Look for things like Rails.env.", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/beaf3152558ef61106857ab5f47bbc3affc7c9641afb21603bc839d33e30bf7b.mp3"}, {"text": "and add your new environment to these conditionals like below", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/9860c480e931f5466ffbb3ddde3fb52e453ef63425885d862ed321576c9edfe8.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 0.66], [4, 0.66, 1.14], [5, 1.14, 1.42], [6, 1.42, 1.6], [7, 1.6, 2.22], [8, 2.22, 2.36], [9, 2.36, 2.68]]}]}